GENE: {{ gene_symbol }}

ASSOCIATION:
Disease: {{ association.description }}
Mode of inheritance: {{ inheritance }}
Rating from the papers: {{ rating }}{% if capped %} (every confidence term is capped at Suspected){% endif %}

Independent families: {{ association.independent_family_count if association.independent_family_count is not none else "not reported" }}

Summary of the evidence:
{{ association.summary }}

Functional evidence, as the literature review summarised it: {{ association.functional }}
Mechanism, as the literature review summarised it: {{ association.mechanism_text }}

VARIANTS OF THIS ASSOCIATION'S FAMILIES:
{% if association.variants %}
{% for row in association.variants %}
- {{ row.hgvs }} | papers: {{ row.paper_ids }} | gnomAD: {{ row.gnomad }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
None recorded.
{% endif %}

THE GENE'S OTHER ASSOCIATIONS:
{% if association.others %}
{% for other in association.others %}
- {{ other.description }}; mode of inheritance: {{ other.inheritance }}; mechanism, as the literature review summarised it: {{ other.mechanism_text }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
None.
{% endif %}

CLINGEN DOSAGE SENSITIVITY OF {{ gene_symbol }}:
{% if dosage %}
Haploinsufficiency: {{ dosage.haploinsufficiency }}. Triplosensitivity: {{ dosage.triplosensitivity }}. Curated {{ dosage.date }}. The curation is for the gene and does not name the disease here: it bears on the monoallelic disease that heterozygous loss-of-function variants and deletions cause.
{% else %}
Not curated.
{% endif %}

CLINGEN GENE-DISEASE VALIDITY CURATIONS OF {{ gene_symbol }}:
{% if clingen_curations %}
{% for curation in clingen_curations %}
- {{ curation.disease_label }} ({{ curation.mondo_id }}); {{ curation.moi }}; {{ curation.classification }}; {{ curation.expert_panel }}, {{ curation.date }}
{% if curation.evidence_summary %}
  Evidence summary: {{ curation.evidence_summary | replace("\n", " ") }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
None.
{% endif %}

MECHANISM EVIDENCE FROM THIS ASSOCIATION'S PAPERS:
{% for paper in association.papers %}

Paper {{ paper.paper_id }}:
{% if paper.reading is none %}
  Not read for mechanism evidence.
{% else %}
  Authors' conclusion: {{ paper.reading.authors_conclusion }}
{% if paper.reading.evidence %}
{% for item in paper.reading.evidence %}
  - [{{ item.mechanism }}; {{ item.evidence_type }}] {{ item.finding }}
    Quote: "{{ item.quote | replace("\n", " ") }}"
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
  No evidence on the mechanism of this association.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
